\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\f0\fs24\cf0
\pard\plain \tx0\tx360\tx720\tx1080\tx1440\tx1800\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\fi360\ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 The wind blows as hard as it can muster, the grass danced atop that cliff.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 At the corner of that cliff, sat a lighthouse.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Except that it is not a lighthouse, it is a place for medicine.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 On that rooftop is a boy in his early twenties, his hair brunette and unruly, }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 He seems to be looking at something, far beyond the horizon. Cigarette in between his finger,}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Crackle crackle, he inhaled the smoke into his body, and let it go, the smoke as if blended with the air and become a cloud, together with his worries.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Edward!\u8221\'94 the voice called deep inside the room, muffled}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Oh shit.\u8221\'94 He cursed, throwing his cigarette deep into the cliff below, and fanning the smokes, \u8220\'93Coming, mom!\u8221\'94}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\pard\plain \sa180\sb180\ltrch\loch {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 "How many times I've told you to not climb to the rooftop! That roof tiles has been there for centuries- And, have you been smoking?"}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 "Um no, not at all, and Sorry mom, how'd you get in by the way, i locked my door!"}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 Mrs. Welton didn't say anything, she just goes to her pocket and fished out a wand that looked like a piece of driftwood}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8220\'93Oh\u8230\'85 that.\u8221\'94 Eddie sighed, \u8220\'93You\u8217\'92ve got to stop using the unlocking charm to unlock my door mom, didn\u8217\'92t you know that\u8217\'92s an offence under Article 6 in the new legislation from the Ministry of Magical Use?\u8221\'94\line \line \u8220\'93I\u8217\'92m your mother, Edward. And you\u8217\'92d be one ungrateful child to sue me with a law that was made, recklessly over a bottle of whiskey.\u8221\'94\line \line \u8220\'93Now you\u8217\'92re just insulting the Ministry, didn\u8217\'92t you know that-\u8220\'93}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8220\'93I come here with urgency Edward. It\u8217\'92s about your sister.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93What did Torrie do this time?\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Liese Academy had summoned me earlier this morning, saying that she had gotten into a duel with three other students.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Whoa, three other students. Did she win?\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93That is not something that you should be concerned about, Edward.\u8221\'94 Mrs. Welton said, \u8220\'93Me and your father had orders to fill down at the Apothecary, so I want you to go there and pick up your sister.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Why me? Can\u8217\'92t you just go when you finish with whatever batch of potions left?\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93I can\u8217\'92t Edward,\u8221\'94 her voice softens this time, \u8220\'93I\u8217\'92m sorry but I need you to do this for me.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Alright.\u8221\'94 }}